INSTALLATION IN ARMBIAN
-----------------------

This software have been tested in Armbian 5.37 (using a modified kernel 3.4.114 with RT patch)
This distribution has some bugs that need to be solved manually:
  - firmware package need to be updated after installation
  - /etc/defaults/ap6212:
    · Especified port must be changed to ttyS3 where bluetooth is connected.
    ·  MAC addres is Invalid, and equal for every device, this can be solved replacing the line with:
      MAC_ADDR=`ifconfig wlan0 | grep -o -E '([[:xdigit:]]{1,2}:){5}[[:xdigit:]]{1,2}'`

For bluetooth a bridge with DHCP service is needed. Is prefered to configure it in /etc/network/interfaces to avoid
network manager to take control. Add this lines to /etc/network/interfaces:
  # Bluetooth bridge
  auto br0
  iface br0 inet static
        bridge_ports none
        bridge_stp off
        address 10.0.0.1
        netmask 255.255.255.0

dnsmasq need to be configured to provide DHCP service on the bridge, add this lines to /etc/dnsmasq.conf
  interface=br0
  dhcp-range=10.0.0.2,10.0.0.8,12h

change bluetooth config and set class to 0x020510 and set timeouts to 0